{
  "id": "alg7-c4-s3-n43",
  "card_id": "alg7-c4-s3-n43",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": "§12. 二次方程",
  "number": "43",
  "title": "用配出二项式的平方的方法解二次方程",
  "printed_title": "43. 用配出二项式的平方的方法解二次方程",
  "start_page": 255,
  "start_printed": 249,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 3,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们可以用图解法解二次方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们可以用图解法解二次方程",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2+6x+5=0$. （1）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2+6x+5=0$.　（1）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "不用作图能不能解这个方程？",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "不用作图能不能解这个方程？",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们由三项式 $x^2+6x+5$ 配出二项式的平方. 如果把 $x^2$这一项看成二项式第一项的平方，而把 $6x$ 这一项看成第一项与第二项的积的两倍，那么由恒等式 $6x=2\\cdot x\\cdot3$ 可以明显地看出，二项式的第二项是 3. 把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $3^2$ 和 $-3^2$ 加到三项式里，得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们由三项式 $x^2+6x+5$ 配出二项式的平方. 如果把 $x^2$这一项看成二项式第一项的平方，而把 $6x$ 这一项看成第一项与第二项的积的两倍，那么由恒等式 $6x=2\\cdot x\\cdot3$ 可以明显地看出，二项式的第二项是 3. 把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $3^2$ 和 $-3^2$ 加到三项式里，得到：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2+6x+5=x^2+6x+3^2-3^2+5=(x^2+6x+9)-9+5=(x+3)^2-4$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2+6x+5=x^2+6x+3^2-3^2+5=(x^2+6x+9)-9+5=(x+3)^2-4$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程（1）和下列方程同解：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程（1）和下列方程同解：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(x+3)^2-4=0$. （2）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "$(x+3)^2-4=0$.　（2）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们把方程（2）的左边作为平方差分解因式，得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们把方程（2）的左边作为平方差分解因式，得到：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(x+3-2)(x+3+2)=0$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "$(x+3-2)(x+3+2)=0$，",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "就是",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "就是",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(x+1)(x+5)=0$. （3）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#15"
      ],
      "source_text": "$(x+1)(x+5)=0$.　（3）",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程（3）的根的集合，也就是和它同解的方程（1）根的集合，是 $\\{-5,-1\\}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 249,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0255#16",
        "p0256#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程（3）的根的集合，也就是和它同解的方程（1）根的集合，是 $\\{-5,-1\\}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们利用在方程的左边配一个二项式的平方的方法（简称：配方法），再解几个 $ax^2+bx+c=0$（$a\\neq0$）这种形式的方程.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们利用在方程的左边配一个二项式的平方的方法（简称：配方法），再解几个 $ax^2+bx+c=0$（$a\\neq0$）这种形式的方程.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 1 解方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 1　解方程",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2-5x+8=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2-5x+8=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由三项式 $x^2-5x+8$ 配出二项式的平方. 如果把 $x^2$ 看成二项式第一项的平方，而把 $5x$ 看成第一项与第二项的和的两倍（$5x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}$），那么二项式的第二项是 $\\frac{5}{2}$. 把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2$ 和 $-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2$ 加到三项式里，得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "由三项式 $x^2-5x+8$ 配出二项式的平方. 如果把 $x^2$ 看成二项式第一项的平方，而把 $5x$ 看成第一项与第二项的和的两倍（$5x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}$），那么二项式的第二项是 $\\frac{5}{2}$. 把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2$ 和 $-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2$ 加到三项式里，得到：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2-5x+8=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}+\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+8=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{25}{4}+8=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2-5x+8=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}+\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+8=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{25}{4}+8=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "已知方程和下列方程同解：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "已知方程和下列方程同解：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}$ 是正的，于是所得到的方程的解集合是空集，因此方程 $x^2-5x+8=0$ 的解集合是空集.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}$ 是正的，于是所得到的方程的解集合是空集，因此方程 $x^2-5x+8=0$ 的解集合是空集.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2 解方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 2　解方程",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2-18x+81=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2-18x+81=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程左边的三项式恒等于二项式 $x-9$ 的平方. 就是说，这个方程可以写成",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 250,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0256#12",
        "p0257#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程左边的三项式恒等于二项式 $x-9$ 的平方. 就是说，这个方程可以写成",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(x-9)^2=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "$(x-9)^2=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "显然，仅当 $x=9$ 时，方程的左边变成零.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "显然，仅当 $x=9$ 时，方程的左边变成零.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程 $x^2-18x+81=0$ 只有唯一的根 9.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程 $x^2-18x+81=0$ 只有唯一的根 9.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 3 解方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 3　解方程",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$3x^2-11x-20=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$3x^2-11x-20=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "用 $x^2$ 的系数除方程的两边，得到和已知方程同解的简化的二次方程：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "用 $x^2$ 的系数除方程的两边，得到和已知方程同解的简化的二次方程：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为 $\\frac{11}{3}x$ 可以看成 $x$ 与 $\\frac{11}{6}$ 的积的两倍（$\\frac{11}{3}x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}$），所以把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2$ 和 $-\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2$加到三项式 $x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}$ 里以后，可以由它配出一个二项式的平方. 得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为 $\\frac{11}{3}x$ 可以看成 $x$ 与 $\\frac{11}{6}$ 的积的两倍（$\\frac{11}{3}x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}$），所以把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2$ 和 $-\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2$加到三项式 $x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}$ 里以后，可以由它配出一个二项式的平方. 得到：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}+\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{20}{3}=\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{361}{36}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "$x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}+\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{20}{3}=\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{361}{36}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程具有下列形式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "方程具有下列形式：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{361}{36}=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{361}{36}=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所得到的方程和下列方程同解：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "所得到的方程和下列方程同解：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}-\\frac{19}{6}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}+\\frac{19}{6}\\right)=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 251,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0257#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}-\\frac{19}{6}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}+\\frac{19}{6}\\right)=0$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是，也和方程 $(x-5)\\left(x+\\frac{4}{3}\\right)=0$ 同解. 解这个方程，求出方程 $3x^2-11x-20=0$ 的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{4}{3},5\\right\\}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "于是，也和方程 $(x-5)\\left(x+\\frac{4}{3}\\right)=0$ 同解. 解这个方程，求出方程 $3x^2-11x-20=0$ 的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{4}{3},5\\right\\}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
