          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2+6x+5=x^2+6x+3^2-3^2+5=(x^2+6x+9)-9+5=(x+3)^2-4$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 249,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0255#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程（1）和下列方程同解：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 249,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0255#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$(x+3)^2-4=0$.　（2）",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 249,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0255#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们把方程（2）的左边作为平方差分解因式，得到：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 249,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0255#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$(x+3-2)(x+3+2)=0$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 249,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0255#13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "就是",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 249,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0255#14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$(x+1)(x+5)=0$.　（3）",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 249,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0255#15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程（3）的根的集合，也就是和它同解的方程（1）根的集合，是 $\\{-5,-1\\}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 249,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0255#16",
            "p0256#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们利用在方程的左边配一个二项式的平方的方法（简称：配方法），再解几个 $ax^2+bx+c=0$（$a\\neq0$）这种形式的方程.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "例 1　解方程",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2-5x+8=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由三项式 $x^2-5x+8$ 配出二项式的平方. 如果把 $x^2$ 看成二项式第一项的平方，而把 $5x$ 看成第一项与第二项的和的两倍（$5x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}$），那么二项式的第二项是 $\\frac{5}{2}$. 把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2$ 和 $-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2$ 加到三项式里，得到：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2-5x+8=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}+\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+8=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{25}{4}+8=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "已知方程和下列方程同解：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}$ 是正的，于是所得到的方程的解集合是空集，因此方程 $x^2-5x+8=0$ 的解集合是空集.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "例 2　解方程",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2-18x+81=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程左边的三项式恒等于二项式 $x-9$ 的平方. 就是说，这个方程可以写成",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 250,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0256#12",
            "p0257#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$(x-9)^2=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "显然，仅当 $x=9$ 时，方程的左边变成零.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程 $x^2-18x+81=0$ 只有唯一的根 9.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "例 3　解方程",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$3x^2-11x-20=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "用 $x^2$ 的系数除方程的两边，得到和已知方程同解的简化的二次方程：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为 $\\frac{11}{3}x$ 可以看成 $x$ 与 $\\frac{11}{6}$ 的积的两倍（$\\frac{11}{3}x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}$），所以把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2$ 和 $-\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2$加到三项式 $x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}$ 里以后，可以由它配出一个二项式的平方. 得到：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}+\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{20}{3}=\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{361}{36}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方程具有下列形式：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{361}{36}=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "所得到的方程和下列方程同解：",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}-\\frac{19}{6}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}+\\frac{19}{6}\\right)=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 251,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0257#14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "于是，也和方程 $(x-5)\\left(x+\\frac{4}{3}\\right)=0$ 同解. 解这个方程，求出方程 $3x^2-11x-20=0$ 的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{4}{3},5\\right\\}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 252,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0258#1"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "section_breaks": [],
  "errata": []
}
